---
import { METHOD } from "../data/content";
---
<section id="methode" class="section-pad relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-10">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 mb-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <p class="chip mb-5">Notre méthode</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-5xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-slate-900">
          De l'audit<br/>
          au <span class="italic text-brand-600">run quotidien</span>.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:pt-14">
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Quatre étapes, un livrable concret à chaque étape. Pas de gantt à six mois, pas de bullshit livrable. <strong class="text-slate-900">On code tôt, on déploie souvent, on mesure tout.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
      {METHOD.map((m, i) => (
        <article class="card p-7 lg:p-8 relative group hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-100/50 transition-all min-h-[280px] flex flex-col">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="font-display text-7xl text-slate-200 group-hover:text-brand-200 transition-colors">{m.step}</span>
            {i < METHOD.length - 1 && (
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-slate-300 group-hover:text-brand-500 transition-colors hidden lg:block" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
            )}
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl mb-3 text-slate-900">{m.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm flex-1">{m.body}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
